    <string name="companion_disclosure_title">Start a read-only check?</string>
    <string name="companion_disclosure_diagnostics">The agent will run a fixed read-only script to collect OS version, uptime, CPU load, memory, disk usage and network addresses. It does not read personal file contents, keystrokes or the clipboard.</string>
    <string name="companion_disclosure_services">This reads service names, display names, states, and start mode. Executable paths, arguments, and environment values are not read.</string>
    <string name="companion_disclosure_processes">This reads process IDs, names, CPU, and memory. Command lines, users, and open files are not read.</string>
    <string name="companion_disclosure_privacy">The app keeps results in memory. The server stores job results for up to seven days or until you delete them.</string>
