    <string name="companion_help_title">Quick help</string>
    <string name="companion_help_body">This is a guided read-only check. It can confirm high disk or memory pressure and can perform one confirmed service action. It cannot prove an unknown cause.</string>
    <string name="companion_help_step_1">1. Read diagnostics and check the measured thresholds.</string>
    <string name="companion_help_step_2">2. If a service is relevant, open Services and choose start, stop, or restart.</string>
    <string name="companion_help_step_3">3. Confirm the action. The server checks the final service state.</string>
    <string name="companion_help_step_4">4. Run diagnostics again by button and compare the measured values.</string>
    <string name="companion_help_step_5">5. Share the anonymized report if you need help.</string>
